### 1. Create a FULL daily log 
POST http://localhost:5001/api/daily-log/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "6637a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0", 
    "familyCode": "482931", 
    "vitals": {
        "bloodPressure": "120/80",
        "bloodSugarLevel": 95,
        "weight": 75,
        "heartRate": 72
    },
    "medsTaken": [
        { "name": "Metformin", "status": true }
    ],
    "waterIntake": 6,
    "notes": "Feeling great today!"
}

### 2. Create a PARTIAL daily log 
# (This is perfect for when they just want to update water or notes)
POST http://localhost:5001/api/daily-log/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "6637a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d1", 
    "familyCode": "482931",
    "waterIntake": 8,
    "notes": "Drank lots of water after playing basketball."
}

### 3. Get all logs for the family 
GET http://localhost:5001/api/daily-log/family/482931

### 4. Get Family Streak
GET http://localhost:5001/api/daily-log/streak/482931